1
00:00:00,060 --> 00:00:09,254
We saw the ad in the summer, in about July, I think, but we weren't really serious about moving then, so we didn't even go and see it.

2
00:00:09,667 --> 00:00:15,963
It wasn't until November, when they re-advertised it, that we got in touch with the agency and had a look.

3
00:00:16,013 --> 00:00:26,105
They'd put the price down since the summer, too, I suppose because it had been empty so long, so that made it more affordable for us, which helped us make up our minds.

4
00:00:26,344 --> 00:00:31,659
It was perfect, a bigger garden for the kids and enough space for an office.

5
00:00:31,997 --> 00:00:37,615
In winter it was lovely, very cosy, in fact, which is important to me.
